The target also translates robust 1.2.0 (https://github.com/georust/robust),
Copyright (c) 2017 The Spade Developers and Copyright (c) 2020 The GeoRust
Project Developers, and float_next_after 1.0.0 (https://crates.io/crates/float_next_after),
